1
00:00:58,200 --> 00:00:59,520
Sun Xiaofei is recovering well.

2
00:01:00,359 --> 00:01:00,759
Here.

3
00:01:00,759 --> 00:01:02,920
This is the voluntary discharge agreement.

4
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:05,120
And this is the discharge condition notice.

5
00:01:05,319 --> 00:01:06,400
Take a look.

6
00:01:06,439 --> 00:01:07,519
If there are no issues,

7
00:01:07,519 --> 00:01:08,959
you can sign right here.

8
00:01:08,959 --> 00:01:11,040
Then you can take Sun Xiaofei home.

9
00:01:11,239 --> 00:01:12,680
But I must reiterate,

10
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:14,319
once you take Sun Xiaofei home,

11
00:01:14,319 --> 00:01:15,680
it's at your own risk.

12
00:01:15,879 --> 00:01:18,400
Also, if her condition relapses

13
00:01:18,560 --> 00:01:20,040
or anything else happens,

14
00:01:20,239 --> 00:01:21,079
you, as her family,

15
00:01:21,159 --> 00:01:22,200
must take full responsibility.

16
00:01:28,640 --> 00:01:30,519
All right, we'll discuss it.

17
00:01:30,519 --> 00:01:31,480
Sure, go ahead.

18
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:41,200
It's 140,000 or 150,000 short.

19
00:01:41,200 --> 00:01:42,000
Yeah.

20
00:01:43,040 --> 00:01:44,799
But given our daughter's condition...

21
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:48,200
50,000 it is, then.

22
00:01:48,680 --> 00:01:49,439
All right.

23
00:01:49,439 --> 00:01:50,680
Bring the girl over.

24
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:51,079
Okay.

25
00:01:57,840 --> 00:01:58,599
Look,

26
00:01:59,799 --> 00:02:00,760
you know as well as I do

27
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:03,439
the bride price around here is 188,000.

28
00:02:03,439 --> 00:02:04,319
Yes, of course, right.

29
00:02:04,319 --> 00:02:05,159
Offering only 50,000...

30
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:07,280
I mean, really...

31
00:02:07,280 --> 00:02:08,560
Look, how about this?

32
00:02:09,039 --> 00:02:10,080
50,000 it is.

33
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:11,439
How much did you bring today?

34
00:02:12,080 --> 00:02:12,520
I...

35
00:02:13,400 --> 00:02:14,479
I brought 30,000.

36
00:02:15,439 --> 00:02:16,520
30,000 it is, then.

37
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:17,479
Hand it over.

38
00:02:17,599 --> 00:02:18,039
Okay.

39
00:02:20,919 --> 00:02:21,479
30,000.

40
00:02:21,479 --> 00:02:22,319
Two things.

41
00:02:23,319 --> 00:02:25,879
You can't back out on the other 20,000.

42
00:02:26,439 --> 00:02:27,240
And another thing:

43
00:02:27,639 --> 00:02:29,319
once my girl marries into your family,

44
00:02:29,599 --> 00:02:31,639
you'd better treat her well.

45
00:02:32,759 --> 00:02:33,360
Listen,

46
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:34,319
don't you worry.

47
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:37,479
In our village, our family

48
00:02:37,479 --> 00:02:39,639
is quite respectable.

49
00:02:40,319 --> 00:02:41,439
Besides,

50
00:02:42,560 --> 00:02:44,520
once she marries into our house,

51
00:02:45,319 --> 00:02:47,879
I'll treat her like my own daughter.

52
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:49,280
Don't worry.

53
00:03:08,840 --> 00:03:09,719
Let's go, Xiaofei.

54
00:03:10,639 --> 00:03:11,840
My mom cooked a whole spread,

55
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:13,000
waiting for you to come home.

56
00:03:31,960 --> 00:03:32,919
How are you getting back?

57
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:35,199
I'll head to town later and catch a bus.

58
00:03:35,199 --> 00:03:35,840
Alright.

59
00:03:41,439 --> 00:03:43,039
I'm Chen Shuming.

60
00:03:43,479 --> 00:03:45,319
My family grows greenhouse vegetables.

61
00:03:46,080 --> 00:03:47,639
I never got much schooling,

62
00:03:47,879 --> 00:03:50,039
but folks say I'm dependable.

63
00:03:51,199 --> 00:03:52,599
Our village observes a settling-in night.

64
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:54,120
Don't take it the wrong way.

65
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:57,120
My mom cooked a whole table of food.

66
00:03:57,280 --> 00:03:58,759
She's waiting to start the welcome feast.

67
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:14,400
Xiaofei, you must be hungry.

68
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:16,000
Here, have some meat. Eat up, eat up.

69
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:17,439
This chicken was freshly butchered today.

70
00:04:17,839 --> 00:04:18,839
To build up your strength.

71
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:20,319
Xiaoming, ladle some soup for her.

72
00:04:22,199 --> 00:04:23,639
Here, have some more chicken soup.

73
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:35,079
This family...

74
00:04:35,439 --> 00:04:36,120
Eat some more, Xiaofei.

75
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:37,040
...seems pretty nice.

76
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:38,920
Eat up. Come on, have some more.

77
00:04:39,879 --> 00:04:40,680
Here, Xiaofei.

78
00:05:01,199 --> 00:05:02,000
Settling-in night.

79
00:05:02,959 --> 00:05:04,480
That means the wedding night.

80
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:15,319
What it means is...

81
00:05:17,120 --> 00:05:18,160
Yeah.

82
00:05:19,399 --> 00:05:20,879
I've got some things to do.

83
00:05:21,519 --> 00:05:22,600
You get some rest.

84
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:24,399
Take a break.

85
00:05:46,879 --> 00:05:47,680
Dear.

86
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:49,519
Dear.

87
00:05:49,519 --> 00:05:52,560
Your mom and I will go catch some carp.

88
00:05:52,839 --> 00:05:55,720
We'll stew it tonight to build up your strength.

89
00:05:55,720 --> 00:05:57,079
Th-Then be careful.

90
00:05:57,279 --> 00:05:58,319
All right, will do.

91
00:06:38,839 --> 00:06:39,920
I'm so tired.

92
00:06:41,079 --> 00:06:42,319
Fu Ting.

93
00:08:44,440 --> 00:08:45,240
Xiao Chang!

94
00:08:53,679 --> 00:08:54,440
What's wrong with you?

95
00:08:57,639 --> 00:08:58,080
It's just a bit of blood.

96
00:08:58,080 --> 00:08:59,440
Does it scare you that much?

97
00:09:02,240 --> 00:09:02,879
Who are you?

98
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:05,039
Me?

99
00:09:05,799 --> 00:09:07,120
You don't know who I am?

100
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:09,200
Scared out of your mind?

101
00:09:09,720 --> 00:09:11,039
I'm your mentor, Lao Meng!

102
00:09:13,679 --> 00:09:14,519
Let me tell you,

103
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:16,559
if you really can't handle it,

104
00:09:16,919 --> 00:09:18,080
don't embarrass me here.

105
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:19,759
Get the hell home and sleep!

106
00:09:28,120 --> 00:09:28,759
Chang Yuzhang!

107
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:31,519
Chang Yuzhang!

108
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:33,720
Have you snapped out of it?

109
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:36,879
Listen up.

110
00:09:37,840 --> 00:09:38,960
If you're still breathing,

111
00:09:39,480 --> 00:09:40,679
get over to the scene right now.

112
00:09:41,480 --> 00:09:42,799
Look with your eyes,

113
00:09:43,679 --> 00:09:44,600
and commit it to memory.

114
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:45,320
Check out

115
00:09:45,320 --> 00:09:47,200
why there's blood spattered on the wall,

116
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:48,279
and

117
00:09:48,799 --> 00:09:51,600
where the footprints on the ground lead.

118
00:09:51,600 --> 00:09:53,720
Get every single detail straight.

119
00:09:54,279 --> 00:09:54,919
That way,

120
00:09:55,559 --> 00:09:57,240
the report you write later

121
00:09:57,679 --> 00:09:58,919
won't just be a waste of paper.

122
00:09:59,279 --> 00:09:59,840
Understood.

123
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:05,039
Move it!

124
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:28,480
How could I be Chang Yuzhang?

125
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:41,879
What's your take

126
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:43,600
on this case?

127
00:10:48,279 --> 00:10:49,080
An attack from behind.

128
00:10:51,799 --> 00:10:53,440
The killer walked through the front door.

129
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:56,159
The girl was caught completely off guard.

130
00:10:57,039 --> 00:10:58,799
The first stab came from behind,

131
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:00,759
straight into the heart.

132
00:11:02,519 --> 00:11:03,519
How do you know it hit the heart?

133
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:06,440
From the wound angle and blood loss.

134
00:11:08,559 --> 00:11:10,039
The victim showed no signs of struggle,

135
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,639
nor was her face contorted in fear.

136
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:14,120
That means

137
00:11:14,679 --> 00:11:15,559
it was instantly fatal.

138
00:11:16,559 --> 00:11:17,320
Apart from the first stab,

139
00:11:17,879 --> 00:11:19,159
the next six were follow-up strikes.

140
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:21,919
It's an emotional crime driven by revenge.

141
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:26,679
Lao Meng.

142
00:11:27,399 --> 00:11:28,240
He's right.

143
00:11:30,440 --> 00:11:31,240
Preliminary findings show

144
00:11:32,720 --> 00:11:33,960
a ruptured heart.

145
00:11:34,399 --> 00:11:35,919
All seven stab wounds were fatal,

146
00:11:36,600 --> 00:11:37,279
the first being the primary one.

147
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:46,720
Just blind luck.

148
00:11:51,679 --> 00:11:52,960
Glad to see you're thinking straight.

149
00:11:54,919 --> 00:11:55,720
Go on.

150
00:11:56,559 --> 00:11:59,240
Look into the victim's background,

151
00:11:59,639 --> 00:12:00,639
her social ties,

152
00:12:01,840 --> 00:12:03,559
who she's been in contact with lately,

153
00:12:04,000 --> 00:12:05,080
and if there were any disputes.

154
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:08,039
The victim is Sun Xiaofei,

155
00:12:08,960 --> 00:12:09,960
21 years old.

156
00:12:10,600 --> 00:12:11,399
This March,

157
00:12:11,399 --> 00:12:13,759
discharged from the mental health center.

158
00:12:15,399 --> 00:12:16,480
Associate degree.

159
00:12:17,480 --> 00:12:19,039
Her parents run a grocery store.

160
00:12:19,879 --> 00:12:22,519
The family has a loan guarantee debt.

161
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:24,720
Last year,

162
00:12:25,320 --> 00:12:26,960
she was in a justifiable defense case.

163
00:12:27,639 --> 00:12:29,279
She killed a man who had stalked

164
00:12:30,120 --> 00:12:31,519
and attempted to rape her.

165
00:12:32,679 --> 00:12:33,399
The procuratorate

166
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:36,159
issued a non-prosecution decision.

167
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:40,360
You checked the records already?

168
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:41,840
I know the details well.

169
00:12:47,279 --> 00:12:49,080
Bringing a top academy student like you

170
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:51,120
to the criminal police was the right call.

171
00:12:59,399 --> 00:13:00,440
Go comfort your mother.

172
00:13:00,440 --> 00:13:01,840
Stop crying, don't cry.

173
00:13:03,159 --> 00:13:04,159
Come here for a second.

174
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:08,000
Let me ask you,

175
00:13:08,279 --> 00:13:10,440
tell me what happened. Come, let's step over here.

176
00:13:13,679 --> 00:13:15,399
I need to check a few things with you too.

177
00:13:17,240 --> 00:13:18,360
Lately,

178
00:13:19,240 --> 00:13:21,000
have you had issues with anyone in the village,

179
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:22,720
any bad blood?

180
00:13:24,200 --> 00:13:25,279
Doesn't have to be anything big.

181
00:13:25,919 --> 00:13:27,200
Out in the fields,

182
00:13:27,200 --> 00:13:28,840
an extra stroke of the hoe,

183
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:30,759
or maybe...

184
00:13:30,759 --> 00:13:33,080
a late payment on some business?

185
00:13:33,399 --> 00:13:34,399
Officer Meng,

186
00:13:35,000 --> 00:13:36,639
you know me.

187
00:13:37,399 --> 00:13:40,159
Someone like me doesn't have an ounce

188
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:42,519
of fight in him.

189
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:44,279
All my life,

190
00:13:44,279 --> 00:13:47,120
I've just wanted peace and harmony.

191
00:13:47,480 --> 00:13:48,559
Land, money...

192
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:50,679
my family has never

193
00:13:50,679 --> 00:13:52,960
argued with anyone over that,

194
00:13:52,960 --> 00:13:54,960
or had bad blood. You know that...

195
00:13:57,600 --> 00:13:58,919
Take it easy, calm down first.

196
00:14:00,559 --> 00:14:01,480
You, Chen!

197
00:14:04,320 --> 00:14:05,279
Give me back my daughter!

198
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:07,360
Lao Sun, Lao Sun!

199
00:14:07,679 --> 00:14:08,519
Don't do this, don't!

200
00:14:08,519 --> 00:14:09,320
My poor daughter!

201
00:14:10,559 --> 00:14:11,519
Now that this has happened...

202
00:14:11,519 --> 00:14:12,559
The case isn't even solved yet!

203
00:14:12,559 --> 00:14:14,000
You can't do this, you can't!

204
00:14:16,000 --> 00:14:16,919
My condolences.

205
00:14:16,919 --> 00:14:19,200
Give me back my daughter! Give her back!

206
00:14:19,200 --> 00:14:20,720
Go comfort your wife.

207
00:14:20,919 --> 00:14:22,200
The case will be solved.

208
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:24,039
We're working hard to solve it right now.

209
00:14:25,559 --> 00:14:27,039
Alright, alright, get a hold of yourself.

210
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:29,440
Alright, go comfort her quickly.

211
00:14:29,919 --> 00:14:31,399
Go on, hurry, hurry!

212
00:14:34,639 --> 00:14:35,639
Come with me.

213
00:14:55,360 --> 00:14:56,600
Let's ask door to door.

214
00:14:57,320 --> 00:14:58,039
Solving cases?

215
00:14:58,759 --> 00:14:59,799
It comes down to one thing:

216
00:15:00,519 --> 00:15:01,320
legwork.

217
00:15:03,799 --> 00:15:05,240
What did you just call me?

218
00:15:08,600 --> 00:15:09,840
What was that name?

219
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:12,679
Nothing!

220
00:15:12,919 --> 00:15:13,960
I said you look just like

221
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:15,399
this top lawyer I really admire.

222
00:15:16,159 --> 00:15:16,840
A top lawyer?

223
00:15:18,039 --> 00:15:19,080
Do I look that lucky?

224
00:15:23,360 --> 00:15:25,360
Heard that Chen Jun kid...

225
00:15:25,360 --> 00:15:26,960
got another eight years, right?

226
00:15:28,240 --> 00:15:29,799
That punk is rotten to the core.

227
00:15:30,039 --> 00:15:30,840
Serves him right!

228
00:15:30,960 --> 00:15:31,960
That little bastard...

229
00:15:32,200 --> 00:15:33,440
Nobody can keep him in line?

230
00:15:33,440 --> 00:15:34,279
I find that hard to believe.

231
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:37,720
It's his second time behind bars, isn't it?

232
00:15:38,519 --> 00:15:40,399
Second time behind bars? No.

233
00:15:40,600 --> 00:15:42,639
He was just released after his second time.

234
00:15:42,639 --> 00:15:43,200
What?

235
00:15:44,320 --> 00:15:45,039
About what happened earlier...

236
00:15:45,039 --> 00:15:45,519
What did you say?

237
00:15:45,519 --> 00:15:46,200
Let's go talk to them.

238
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:47,759
Last time, about that land dispute...

239
00:15:47,759 --> 00:15:49,320
He was the one who grabbed our plot.

240
00:15:50,000 --> 00:15:52,919
Chatting, folks? Here, come on.

241
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:54,639
Here.

242
00:15:54,840 --> 00:15:55,759
Have a handful of melon seeds.

243
00:15:55,759 --> 00:15:56,960
Sure, thanks.

244
00:15:58,399 --> 00:15:58,960
All right.

245
00:16:01,120 --> 00:16:02,679
In your village here,

246
00:16:03,440 --> 00:16:04,799
with this incident happening,

247
00:16:05,799 --> 00:16:07,559
did you hear anything unusual?

248
00:16:08,559 --> 00:16:09,240
Sure did!

249
00:16:09,639 --> 00:16:13,080
The Chens fought with Chen Jun before New Year's.

250
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:14,799
All over the homestead plot.

251
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:16,320
Ain't that the truth!

252
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:18,080
That Chen Jun,

253
00:16:18,080 --> 00:16:19,960
you wouldn't believe how nasty he can be.

254
00:16:20,399 --> 00:16:21,600
He insisted that

255
00:16:21,600 --> 00:16:24,080
their new room took a sliver of his plot.

256
00:16:24,480 --> 00:16:27,000
That day, at the village entrance,

257
00:16:27,159 --> 00:16:28,200
the shouting was so wild,

258
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:30,080
spit was flying everywhere!

259
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:32,120
Then he even threw out a threat,

260
00:16:32,399 --> 00:16:33,879
saying he'd make their lives miserable.

261
00:16:33,879 --> 00:16:34,919
Just listen to that.

262
00:16:34,919 --> 00:16:36,320
What kind of person talks like that?

263
00:16:38,679 --> 00:16:39,840
Cruel words...

264
00:16:40,279 --> 00:16:41,360
You bet.

265
00:16:41,399 --> 00:16:42,360
chill even in midsummer.

266
00:16:43,080 --> 00:16:44,279
On the day of the crime,

267
00:16:44,919 --> 00:16:46,799
that's the night of the thirteenth,

268
00:16:47,600 --> 00:16:49,440
did any of you see Chen Jun?

269
00:16:49,679 --> 00:16:50,399
Where was he?

270
00:16:50,879 --> 00:16:52,039
You're asking the right people!

271
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:54,200
It just so happened that day,

272
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:57,320
Dong Chen hosted his grandson's wedding.

273
00:16:58,200 --> 00:17:00,360
He hired an opera troupe at the old stage

274
00:17:00,759 --> 00:17:01,720
to perform The Execution of Chen Shimei.

275
00:17:01,799 --> 00:17:02,879
It was packed!

276
00:17:03,759 --> 00:17:05,240
Chen Jun sat right in the front row,

277
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:06,519
legs crossed.

278
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:09,160
Then, for some reason,

279
00:17:09,759 --> 00:17:11,279
he argued with the guy next to him.

280
00:17:11,680 --> 00:17:12,799
Nearly threw punches.

281
00:17:14,039 --> 00:17:15,279
Right when the opening gong sounded,

282
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:17,279
around seven o'clock or so.

283
00:17:21,839 --> 00:17:22,559
Hey there, folks.

284
00:17:23,599 --> 00:17:24,440
Hello, hello!

285
00:17:25,079 --> 00:17:25,359
Over here.

286
00:17:25,359 --> 00:17:26,079
Hello, Lao Meng.

287
00:17:26,119 --> 00:17:26,599
Catching up?

288
00:17:26,599 --> 00:17:27,920
Talking about some secrets, huh?

289
00:17:27,920 --> 00:17:28,440
Right?

290
00:17:28,880 --> 00:17:29,440
Not at all.

291
00:17:29,440 --> 00:17:30,000
Take a seat.

292
00:17:30,000 --> 00:17:30,880
Join us!

293
00:17:30,880 --> 00:17:31,759
Sure, sure.

294
00:17:32,799 --> 00:17:34,519
I heard you folks might know...

295
00:17:34,519 --> 00:17:35,440
a thing or two about this?

296
00:17:36,920 --> 00:17:37,720
You bet!

297
00:17:38,000 --> 00:17:38,920
Right after the gong sounded,

298
00:17:39,440 --> 00:17:41,160
before Judge Bao even took the stage,

299
00:17:41,400 --> 00:17:43,079
that second Chen boy started trouble.

300
00:17:43,480 --> 00:17:45,880
He spat right on a guy's new pants!

301
00:17:46,039 --> 00:17:47,279
How could the guy not get furious?

302
00:17:47,640 --> 00:17:49,359
He grabbed his collar, ready to brawl!

303
00:17:49,680 --> 00:17:51,359
Good thing we pulled them apart.

304
00:17:51,960 --> 00:17:53,960
Then he came back to watch the opera.

305
00:17:55,640 --> 00:17:57,200
That certainly sounds like him.

306
00:17:59,960 --> 00:18:01,400
Are you sure he came back?
